  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 4a: untwisting limit, LOCUS family (w1 = z1)\nz = 1 + e phi, kappa = 1 - c e, w2,w3,w4 fixed. After n (= n_f here since v = e1), first-pair F vector F1 = f(1-kappa Lambda) n^{-T}, A vector = e1. Report F1 to leading order and the normalised direction.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "utphi = {utp1, utp2, utp3, utp4}; utzE = 1 + ute utphi;\nutfLoc = Table[utell[{1 + ute utp1, utw2, utw3, utw4}, utzE[[j]]], {j, 4}];\nutF1Loc = Together[(utfLoc (1 - (1 - utc ute) utzE)).Transpose[Inverse[utnf[utfLoc]]]];\nutF1LocLead = Simplify[Limit[utF1Loc/ute, ute -> 0]];\nutratLoc = Simplify[Limit[utfLoc[[2 ;; 3]]/utfLoc[[4]], ute -> 0]];\nutF1Locfix = Simplify[Limit[Together[(utfLoc (1 - utkf utzE)).Transpose[Inverse[utnf[utfLoc]]]], ute -> 0]];\nGrid[{{\"f_j/f_4 (j=2,3) as e->0\", utratLoc}, {\"F1/e leading (components 1..4)\", utF1LocLead}, {\"kappa fixed: F1 at e=0\", utF1Locfix}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
