  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Note f_j = O(e) overall on the locus (f vanishes at w1 -> 1), so normalise f by f_4 (overall pair scale is irrelevant): F1/f_4.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "utF1n = Together[utF1Loc/utfLoc[[4]]];\nutF1nLead = Simplify[Limit[utF1n/ute, ute -> 0]];\nutF1nfix = Simplify[Limit[Together[(utfLoc (1 - utkf utzE)).Transpose[Inverse[utnf[utfLoc]]]/utfLoc[[4]]], ute -> 0]];\nutF1nGen = Simplify[Limit[Together[(utfLoc (1 - utkf utzE)).Transpose[Inverse[utnf[utfLoc]]]/utfLoc[[4]]/(1 - utkf)], ute -> 0]];\nutalpha = Simplify[utF1nLead[[2]]/utF1nLead[[4]]]; utbeta = Simplify[utF1nLead[[3]]/utF1nLead[[4]]];\nGrid[{{\"F1/(f4 e) leading\", utF1nLead}, {\"alpha=comp2/comp4\", utalpha}, {\"beta=comp3/comp4\", utbeta}, {\"kappa fixed: F1/f4 at e=0\", utF1nfix}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
