  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 4b: GENERIC-w family, first pair (v_w G^{-T}, u_w(alpha + beta G)) -> diagonal frame (v' Lambda^{-1}, f(alpha+beta Lambda)), v'_j = Lagrange l_j(w1). Rest of chain: reference pairs (v',f). n = n_f n_v (a=0) brings the reference pair to e1 (x) e4. Limit z=1+e phi, w fixed, alpha = -beta + c e. Numerical (exact rational) phi, w first.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "utlimGen[phiv_List, wv_List] := Module[{zE, vv, ff, n, A1, F1, sub},\n zE = 1 + ute phiv;\n vv = Table[Product[If[k == j, 1, (wv[[1]] - zE[[k]])/(zE[[j]] - zE[[k]])], {k, 4}], {j, 4}];\n ff = Table[utell[wv, zE[[j]]], {j, 4}];\n n = utnfull[vv, ff, 0];\n A1 = (vv/zE).n; F1 = (ff (-utb + utb zE + utc ute)).Transpose[Inverse[n]];\n {Simplify[Limit[Together[A1/A1[[1]]], ute -> 0]], Simplify[Limit[Together[F1/ute/ff[[4]]], ute -> 0]], Simplify[Limit[Together[(vv.n)/vv[[1]]], ute -> 0]], Simplify[Limit[Together[(ff.Transpose[Inverse[n]])/ff[[4]]], ute -> 0]]}];\nutGenNum = utlimGen[{1/3, 2/5, -1/2, 3/7}, {7/5, 2, 3, 5/9}];\nGrid[{{\"A1 (norm. by comp 1)\", utGenNum[[1]]}, {\"F1/(e f4)\", utGenNum[[2]]}, {\"ref A after n\", utGenNum[[3]]}, {\"ref F after n\", utGenNum[[4]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
