  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Check: second numeric point, formula F1/(e f4) = (0, beta (phi2-phi4), beta (phi3-phi4), c + beta phi4); next order (e1 component, A-vector correction), and the special choice w2=z2, w3=z3.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "utserGen[phiv_List, wfun_] := Module[{zE, wv, vv, ff, n, A1, F1},\n zE = 1 + ute phiv; wv = wfun[zE];\n vv = Table[Product[If[k == j, 1, (wv[[1]] - zE[[k]])/(zE[[j]] - zE[[k]])], {k, 4}], {j, 4}];\n ff = Table[utell[wv, zE[[j]]], {j, 4}];\n n = utnfull[vv, ff, 0];\n A1 = (vv/zE).n; F1 = (ff (-utb + utb zE + utc ute)).Transpose[Inverse[n]];\n {Simplify[Series[Together[A1/A1[[1]]], {ute, 0, 1}]], Simplify[Series[Together[F1/ff[[4]]], {ute, 0, 2}]]}];\nutphi2 = {1/5, -2/3, 3/4, 5/6};\nutGenA = utserGen[utphi2, {7/5, 2, 3, 5/9} &];\nutGenB = utserGen[utphi2, {7/5, #[[2]], #[[3]], 5/9} &];\nutchkGen2 = Simplify[Normal[utGenA[[2]]] /. ute -> 0] ;\nGrid[{{\"fixed w: A1/A1_1 to O(e)\", utGenA[[1]]}, {\"fixed w: F1/f4 to O(e^2)\", utGenA[[2]]}, {\"w2=z2,w3=z3: A1\", utGenB[[1]]}, {\"w2=z2,w3=z3: F1/f4\", utGenB[[2]]}, {\"formula (0,b(p2-p4),b(p3-p4),c+b p4)\", utb {0, utphi2[[2]] - utphi2[[4]], utphi2[[3]] - utphi2[[4]], utphi2[[4]]} + {0, 0, 0, utc}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
