  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Special choice w2=z2, w3=z3 gives F1 -> e4 + alpha~ e1 (traceful). Extract alpha~ symbolically (phi, w1, w4 symbolic).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "utzE = 1 + ute utphi;\nutwB = {utw1, utzE[[2]], utzE[[3]], utw4};\nutvB = Table[Product[If[k == j, 1, (utwB[[1]] - utzE[[k]])/(utzE[[j]] - utzE[[k]])], {k, 4}], {j, 4}];\nutfB = Table[utell[utwB, utzE[[j]]], {j, 4}];\nutnB = utnfull[utvB, utfB, 0];\nutF1B = (utfB (-utb + utb utzE + utc ute)).Transpose[Inverse[utnB]]/utfB[[4]];\nutA1B = (utvB/utzE).utnB;\nutaltil = Simplify[Limit[Together[utF1B[[1]]/utF1B[[4]]], ute -> 0]];\nutA1Bl = Simplify[Limit[Together[utA1B/utA1B[[1]]], ute -> 0]];\nutF1Bother = Simplify[Limit[Together[utF1B[[{2, 3}]]/utF1B[[4]]], ute -> 0]];\nGrid[{{\"alpha~ = lim F1_1/F1_4\", utaltil}, {\"F1_{2,3}/F1_4\", utF1Bother}, {\"A1 limit\", utA1Bl}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
