  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Tasks 3, 5: numerics at z=(3/2,5/4,2/3,4/7), w=(7/5,z2,z3,5/9); explicit n, a; finite-twist pairings in the companion frame vs diagonal frame, for both families.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "utzn = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3, 4/7}; utwn = {7/5, utzn[[2]], utzn[[3]], 5/9}; utwg = {7/5, 2, 3, 5/9};\nutdata[wv_List] := Module[{vv, ff, vc, uc, G}, G = utGc[utzn]; vc = utvw[wv[[1]]]; uc = utuw[wv]; vv = vc.Transpose[Inverse[utVm[utzn]]]; ff = uc.utVm[utzn]; {vv, ff, vc, uc, G}];\nutpair[wv_List] := Module[{vv, ff, vc, uc, G}, {vv, ff, vc, uc, G} = utdata[wv];\n {{\"B1 diag sum v.f/z\", vv.(ff/utzn)}, {\"B1 companion u G^-1 v\", uc.Inverse[G].vc}, {\"B2/beta diag sum v f z\", vv.(ff utzn)}, {\"B2/beta companion u G v\", uc.G.vc}, {\"u.v\", uc.vc}}];\nutnN = utnfull[utdata[utwg][[1]], utdata[utwg][[2]], uta];\nutnS = utnfull[utdata[utwn][[1]], utdata[utwn][[2]], uta];\nutchkNum = {Simplify[utdata[utwg][[1]].utnN] , Simplify[utdata[utwg][[2]].Transpose[Inverse[utnN]]], Simplify[utdata[utwn][[1]].utnS], Simplify[utdata[utwn][[2]].Transpose[Inverse[utnS]]]};\nGrid[{{\"generic w: v, f (diag)\", utdata[utwg][[1]], utdata[utwg][[2]]}, {\"pairings generic w\", MatrixForm[utpair[utwg]], \"\"}, {\"special w2=z2,w3=z3: v, f\", utdata[utwn][[1]], utdata[utwn][[2]]}, {\"pairings special\", MatrixForm[utpair[utwn]], \"\"}, {\"v n, f n^-T (generic)\", utchkNum[[1]], utchkNum[[2]]}, {\"v n, f n^-T (special)\", utchkNum[[3]], utchkNum[[4]]}, {\"n(a) generic\", MatrixForm[utnN], \"\"}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
