  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 5: overlaps with the saved HW states (kets psi, site 1 most significant; bra . psi without conjugation).\nBras: (i) locus limit (e1 (x) (e4 + a e2 + b e3))^l first, vac after, with (a,b) = (1/3,-2/5); (i') special-generic limit (e1 (x) (e4 + at e1))^l first, at = 1/2; (ii) note bra vac^{L-l} (x) W_{-1}^l (rotated pairs LAST) and W_{-1}^l (x) vac^{L-l} (FIRST), W_{-1} = (e1-e4)(x)(e4+e1); (iii) vac^L. Sector test: A sites all e1 & F in span(e2,e3,e4) <=> ket weight w_1 = L.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "utE1[i_] := UnitVector[4, i];\nutpv[vA_, uF_] := Flatten[Outer[Times, vA, uF]];\nutchain[pl_List] := Fold[Flatten[Outer[Times, #1, #2]] &, First[pl], Rest[pl]];\nutvac = utpv[utE1[1], utE1[4]];\nutWm1 = utpv[utE1[1] - utE1[4], utE1[4] + utE1[1]];\nutlocB[ab_List] := utpv[utE1[1], utE1[4] + ab[[1]] utE1[2] + ab[[2]] utE1[3]];\nutspB[at_] := utpv[utE1[1], utE1[4] + at utE1[1]];\nutbras[L_, l_] := <|\"loc\" -> utchain[Join[ConstantArray[utlocB[{1/3, -2/5}], l], ConstantArray[utvac, L - l]]], \"loc2\" -> utchain[Join[ConstantArray[utlocB[{1, 1}], l], ConstantArray[utvac, L - l]]], \"sp\" -> utchain[Join[ConstantArray[utspB[1/2], l], ConstantArray[utvac, L - l]]], \"noteLast\" -> utchain[Join[ConstantArray[utvac, L - l], ConstantArray[utWm1, l]]], \"noteFirst\" -> utchain[Join[ConstantArray[utWm1, l], ConstantArray[utvac, L - l]]], \"vac\" -> utchain[ConstantArray[utvac, L]]|>;\nutrows[L_, l_] := Module[{b = utbras[L, l], st = utD[\"L\" <> ToString[L]]}, Table[With[{p = st[[k]][\"psi\"]}, {k, st[[k]][\"w\"], st[[k]][\"dyn\"], Chop[N[st[[k]][\"E\"], 6], 10^-6], st[[k]][\"w\"][[1]] == L, Chop[N[b[\"loc\"].p, 6], 10^-9], Chop[N[b[\"loc2\"].p, 6], 10^-9], Chop[N[b[\"sp\"].p, 6], 10^-9], Chop[N[b[\"noteLast\"].p, 6], 10^-9], Chop[N[b[\"noteFirst\"].p, 6], 10^-9], Chop[N[b[\"vac\"].p, 6], 10^-9]}], {k, Length[st]}]];\nutshow[L_, l_] := Grid[Prepend[utrows[L, l], {\"#\", \"w\", \"Dynkin\", \"E\", \"w1=L\", \"loc(1/3,-2/5)\", \"loc(1,1)\", \"special at=1/2\", \"noteLast\", \"noteFirst\", \"vac\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left];\nutR21 = utrows[2, 1]; utR31 = utrows[3, 1]; utR32 = utrows[3, 2];\nutshow[2, 1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
