      {
       "data": "Out[1589]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{max |<e1e1>\\_p - <e4e4>\\_p| over p, states (L=2)} & 6\\\\\\hline\\text{same L=3} & 26\\\\\\hline\\text{max cyclicity violation <e1e1>\\_p, <e4e1>\\_p (L=2,3)} & 7.327682229021408\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
