  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Corrected readout of the identity table (columns of utidT: {k, |<e1e1>_p-<e4e4>_p|, cyclicity of <e1e1>_p, cyclicity of <e4e1>_p}) and overlap of the sector state [4,0,0] (L=3, #2) with the symbolic locus bra at l = 2, plus the maximal-weight check.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "utlocS[L_, l_] := utchain[Join[ConstantArray[utlocB[{utal, utbe}], l], ConstantArray[utvac, L - l]]];\nutpsi32 = utD[\"L3\"][[2]][\"psi\"];\nutov32 = Expand[Chop[utlocS[3, 2].utpsi32, 10^-12]];\nutov32b = Expand[Chop[utlocS[3, 3].utpsi32, 10^-12]];\nutAe1 = Flatten[Outer[Times, UnitVector[4, 1], ConstantArray[1, 4], UnitVector[4, 1], ConstantArray[1, 4], UnitVector[4, 1], ConstantArray[1, 4]]];\nGrid[{{\"max |<e1e1>_p-<e4e4>_p| L=2, L=3\", Max[utidT2[[All, 2]]], Max[utidT3[[All, 2]]]}, {\"max cyclicity violations (L=2, L=3)\", Max[utidT2[[All, 3 ;; 4]]], Max[utidT3[[All, 3 ;; 4]]]}, {\"[4,0,0] state: overlap with locus bra l=2 (symbolic a,b)\", utov32, \"\"}, {\"... l=3\", utov32b, \"\"}, {\"norm of psi, norm of A-all-e1 projection\", Norm[utpsi32], Norm[utpsi32 utAe1]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
