      {
       "data": "Out[1595]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{max |<e1e1>\\_p-<e4e4>\\_p| L=2, L=3} & 7.327682229021408\\times 10^{-16} & 6.106226635438361\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline\\text{max cyclicity violations (L=2, L=3)} & 3.608224830031759\\times 10^{-16} & 2.018550355724188\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline\\text{[4,0,0] state: overlap with locus bra l=2 (symbolic a,b)} & 0 & \\\\\\hline\\text{... l=3} & 0 & \\\\\\hline\\text{norm of psi, norm of A-all-e1 projection} & 1.\\, & 1.\\,\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
