  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary\n- Frame map: v_w V^{-T} = (l_j(w1)) Lagrange coefficients (= e_i on locus w1=z_i), u_w V = (l_w(z_j)), rotated F site f(1-kappa Lambda). All verified symbolically.\n- Locus family, z=1+e phi, kappa=1-c e: pair -> e1 (x) (e4 + alpha e2 + beta e3), alpha = -f2(phi2-phi4)/(c-phi4), beta likewise, f_j/f_4 -> (phi1-phi_j)/(phi1-phi_4). kappa fixed: rotation trivial. Pairings B1=B2=0 identically (q = u G v = z1 u.v = 0).\n- Generic-w family (v G^{-T}, u(alpha+beta G)): finite twist B1 = u G^-1 v, B2 = beta u G v nonzero. Limit alpha=-beta+c e: for generic fixed w the F vector -> e4 (c+beta phi4) + beta sum_{j=2,3}(phi_j-phi_4) e_j, e1 component only O(e^2) relative; A -> e1 + O(e) (e2,e3). For w2=z2,w3=z3: F -> e4 + alpha~ e1, alpha~ = -beta (phi1-phi2)(phi1-phi3)(phi1-phi4)/((phi2-phi4)(phi4-phi3)(c+beta phi4)), A -> e1 (+O(e)); then B2 = alpha~ != 0 but B1 = A_4 = O(e) -> 0.\n- Overlaps with saved HW states: see tables (cells above). Locus bra sees only the BPS vacuum; special-generic bra sees [L-1,0,L-1] states; note bra sees vacuum and [L-2,0,L-2] states, zero on [L-1,0,L-1].\n- Identity <e1e1>_p = <e4e4>_p (E_14 psi=0) and pair-cyclicity verified to 1e-15.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "utshow[3, 2]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
